      "verifiedAt": "2026-11-15T07:03:25+05:30",
      "adapted": true,
      "independentSolution": "Perpendicular normals give k³−k²+2=0=(k+1)(k²−2k+2), so real k=−1. Centre=(1,2), r²=5, d²=1/2; AB²=4(r²−d²)=18."
