      "verifiedAt": "2026-11-15T07:15:51+05:30",
      "adapted": true,
      "independentSolution": "Centre=(3,r), r>0; y-axis intercept 6√3 gives r²−9=27, r=6. Distance to x−y=3 is 3√2; chord=2√(36−18)=6√2.",
